{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2021-08-30 08:00:00', 'title': "VIATRIS INC. TO PARTICIPATE IN CITI'S 16TH ANNUAL BIOPHARMA CONFERENCE", 'text': "PITTSBURGH, AUG. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0VIATRIS\xa0INC. (NASDAQ: VTRS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY WILL TAKE PART IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT CITI'S 16TH ANNUAL BIOPHARMA CONFERENCE ON FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2021. CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER MICHAEL GOETTLER \xa0AND PRESIDENT RAJIV MALIK \xa0WILL ANSWER QUESTIONS ABOUT THE COMPANY AT 11:35 A.M."}